{
  "description": "Issue #9 4WD skid-steer drive on the L298N (left motor pair = channel A, right pair = B). L/R = -1..1 per side, latched on UPD (dashboard D-pad: forward 1/1, reverse -1/-1, left -1/1, right 1/-1, stop 0/0). Slew-limited, minimum duty, 0.6 s dead-man. INH = inhibit (pumps / e-stop). IN1-IN4 -> digital-write, ENA/ENB (0-1) -> pwm-write.",
